{"3394040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Landonia", "steam_appid": 3394040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/f56e62daef3f0ae6a144df754c54cfd0.avif?t=1788240376\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access</strong> - A tribute to the old-school RPGs (Phantasie, Wizardry, Ultima, Might and Magic, Diablo), BBS MUDs (Tele-arena, MajorMUD, The PIT and Blademaster) of the 1990s and early MMORPGs (Everquest).  Landonia is a hardcore old-school, open-world and non-linear single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.  There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.poster.avif?t=1788240376\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.webm?t=1788240376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.mp4?t=1788240376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Two modes of combat that the player can change at anytime:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) Action RPG style for quicker styles of play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with up to 15 party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. For more tactical play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/f56e62daef3f0ae6a144df754c54cfd0.avif?t=1788240376\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access</strong> - A tribute to the old-school RPGs (Phantasie, Wizardry, Ultima, Might and Magic, Diablo), BBS MUDs (Tele-arena, MajorMUD, The PIT and Blademaster) of the 1990s and early MMORPGs (Everquest).  Landonia is a hardcore old-school, open-world and non-linear single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.  There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.poster.avif?t=1788240376\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.webm?t=1788240376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/extras/997427550666923ac6fa399a93eeae6f.mp4?t=1788240376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Two modes of combat that the player can change at anytime:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) Action RPG style for quicker styles of play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with up to 15 party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. For more tactical play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "*Early Access* Landonia is an old-school, non-linear, open-world single-player cRPG that includes parties upto 16 player characters, exploration, loot, factions, grinding, and class and quest-based progression.  Choose between Continuous or Turn-based modes that can alternate at any time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/def956fc0b46708aad692eaffdf005f7aef4fd6f/header.jpg?t=1788240376", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/94efc49f36b49ce3a149653ec41360fb6616791f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788240376", "capsule_imagev5"